    "title": "Khartoum braces for record Nile floods as crisis sweeps Sudan",
    "text": "Abdallah Hussain\nPress TV, Wad Ramli\nHeavy flooding has hit parts of Khartoum and several other states in Sudan as the White and Blue Niles continue to rise.\nHomes and farmland have been inundated, with authorities warning that water levels could climb even higher in the coming days.\nPress TV’s Abdallah Hussain has more details from Wad Ramli, a village in Khartoum hit hard by the flooding.",
